"id":"init","children":[{"type":"text","value":"init"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/WebSocketStreamInit.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WebSocketStreamInit"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Response"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toffset","text":"TOffset","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"request","text":"request","level":3},{"id":"init","text":"init","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction toWebSocketResponse<TOffset>(request, init): Response;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:398](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L398)\n\nCloudflare wrapper (Workers/Durable Objects): creates a `WebSocketPair`,\naccepts the server socket, delegates to [toWebSocketStream](toWebSocketStream.md), and\nreturns the 101 upgrade `Response` carrying the client socket. Throws when\nthe runtime has no `WebSocketPair` (Node, Deno, Bun) — upgrade the socket\nyourself and call [toWebSocketStream](toWebSocketStream.md) directly there.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### request\n\n`Request`\n\n### init\n\n[`WebSocketStreamInit`](../interfaces/WebSocketStreamInit.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Response`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: toWebSocketResponse\ntitle: toWebSocketResponse\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction toWebSocketResponse<TOffset>(request, init): Response;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:398](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L398)\n\nCloudflare wrapper (Workers/Durable Objects): creates a `WebSocketPair`,\naccepts the server socket, delegates to [toWebSocketStream](toWebSocketStream.md), and\nreturns the 101 upgrade `Response` carrying the client socket. Throws when\nthe runtime has no `WebSocketPair` (Node, Deno, Bun) — upgrade the socket\nyourself and call [toWebSocketStream](toWebSocketStream.md) directly there.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### request\n\n`Request`\n\n### init\n\n[`WebSocketStreamInit`](../interfaces/WebSocketStreamInit.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Response`\n"}
